(Let's plan:)
(Initial: sa has task profile linked.)
(Step A: Detach sa -> rtp available.)
(Step B: Attach oa -> oa has tp.)
(Step C: Confirm prepared oa.)
(Step D: Activate origin node.)
(Step E: Release op from sa (to free operator).)
(Step F: Assign op to oa.)
(Step G: Load origin payload oa.)
(Step H: Unload origin payload oa.)
(Step I: Lock origin availability oa.)
(Now we have oa task profile linked still.)
(Step J: Release operator from oa (to free op for destination).)
(Step K: Detach task profile from oa -> rtp available.)
(Step L: Attach task profile to da.)
(Step M: Confirm prepared da.)
(Step N: Activate destination node.)
(Step O: Assign operator to da (need operator available; we released from oa, so operator_available true).)
(Step P: Load destination payload da.)
(Step Q: Unload destination payload da.)
(Step R: Lock destination availability da.)
(Now we have da task profile linked still.)
(Step S: Release operator from da (to free op for later).)
(Step T: Detach task profile from da -> rtp available.)
(Now we have rtp available.)
(Now we need to assemble transport leg: we have oa locked, da locked, nodes ready, confs true, transport leg available.)
(Assemble_transport_leg oa da on dn tl.)
(Now we need to authorize transport leg loading: requires origin_availability_locked oa (true), candidate_task_profile_linked oa rtp (we need oa task profile linked). So we need to attach task profile to oa again.)
(Step U: Attach task profile to oa.)
(Step V: authorize_transport_leg_loading tl oa rtp.)
(Now we have transport leg assembled and loading authorized.)
